<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>HOTEL BEDDING 상세페이지 2부</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --page-width: 1024px;
      --navy: #06213f;
      --navy-deep: #03172c;
      --cream: #fffaf3;
      --kakao: #fee500;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #eee7df;
      color: #24180f;
      font-family: "Pretendard", "Noto Sans KR", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .detail-page {
      width: min(100%, var(--page-width));
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--cream);
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(67, 48, 32, 0.12);
    }

    .top-nav {
      padding: 18px clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px);
      background: #fffaf3;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eadfce;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .top-nav a {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 38px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      border: 1px solid #d9c5a8;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .image-section,
    .final-section {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      line-height: 0;
    }

    .image-section img,
    .final-section img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border: 0;
    }

    .final-section {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .final-cta-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 2;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      top: 51.65%;
      height: 26.8%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: clamp(14px, 3.4vw, 40px) clamp(18px, 5vw, 72px);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 28%, rgba(222, 166, 88, 0.2), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-deep), var(--navy) 54%, #021121);
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .final-cta-content {
      width: min(760px, 100%);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .final-eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 clamp(8px, 1.6vw, 14px);
      color: #f1bd6d;
      font-size: clamp(14px, 2.3vw, 24px);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .final-heading {
      margin: 0 0 clamp(12px, 2.2vw, 22px);
      font-size: clamp(21px, 4vw, 40px);
      font-weight: 800;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    .final-actions {
      display: grid;
      gap: clamp(10px, 2vw, 14px);
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: clamp(44px, 6.4vw, 62px);
      padding: 0 clamp(18px, 4vw, 34px);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: clamp(15px, 2.7vw, 24px);
      font-weight: 850;
      line-height: 1.2;
      transition: transform 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease, filter 160ms ease;
    }

    .cta-button:hover,
    .cta-button:focus-visible {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      filter: brightness(1.02);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      outline: none;
    }

    .cta-button.kakao {
      background: var(--kakao);
      color: #151515;
    }

    .cta-button.form {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      color: #fff;
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .final-cta-overlay {
        top: 51.4%;
        height: 28.8%;
        padding-inline: 16px;
      }

      .final-heading {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="detail-page" aria-label="HOTEL BEDDING 상세페이지 2부">
    <nav class="top-nav" aria-label="상세페이지 이동">
      <a href="index.html">1부로 돌아가기</a>
    </nav>

    <figure class="image-section"><img src="assets/IMG_4450.PNG" alt="배송 안내"></figure>

    <section class="final-section" aria-label="최종 상담 안내">
      <img src="assets/IMG_4451.PNG" alt="좋은 숙소는 침대에서 기억됩니다">
      <div class="final-cta-overlay">
        <div class="final-cta-content">
          <p class="final-eyebrow">개별 상품 구매 / 대량 구매 / 객실 단위 견적 문의</p>
          <h1 class="final-heading">상담이 필요하시면 바로 문의해주세요</h1>
          <div class="final-actions">
            <a class="cta-button kakao" href="https://lemongnote.notion.site/36e51072b18080fcaaa8fb8a0e487d9c?pvs=105">카톡 문의하기</a>
            <a class="cta-button form" href="https://lemongnote.notion.site/36e51072b18080fcaaa8fb8a0e487d9c?pvs=105">문의 양식 작성하기</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
